window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>In a world where prophecies reign supreme, one family’s fight for survival will test the limits of love and loyalty.</p> <p>The fate of humankind rests on the shoulders of one of our own flesh and blood. A child whose mere existence has the power to send shockwaves through the world, throwing everything off balance. But amidst this prophecy lies a grim reality—a second prediction that includes my head on a spike. It’s not my life I’m worried about but my children’s. Two of them have been abducted, and the thought of losing them forever is unbearable.</p> <p>As my formidable vampire husband, Sam Mason, and I traverse this treacherous path, each passing second feels like an eternity, and the mounting obstacles we face only add to the torment. Every suspect brings a new layer of uncertainty, and even our closest allies are not beyond suspicion. And now, a new, dangerous supernatural group has emerged, throwing our plans into disarray.</p> <p>My mind teeters on the brink of madness, not knowing where my children are or if they’re okay. I feel like part of me has been ripped away, leaving an empty void that nothing can fill, and I’m terrified that I might not live long enough to hold Orion and Luna in my arms again.</p> <p>The Prophecy is book six in the continuing saga in this enemies-to-lovers paranormal romance featuring Sam &amp; Layla. Their story is rife with action, suspense, snarky banter, a slow-burn romance that’s sure to singe your e-reader and ends on a cliffhanger. This is an ongoing series that begins in The Hunted. For a better listening experience, the books should be listened to in order.</p> <p>Series Listening Order:</p> <p>1. The Hunted</p> <p>2. The Predator</p> <p>3. The Union</p> <p>4. The Dawning</p> <p>5. The Prodigies</p> <p>6. The Prophecy</p> <p>7. The Rebirth</p>"; 
